- ✅ **XLM reserve** — Balance 10.5 XLM meets the minimum of 1.5 XLM.

### Onboarding checklist

_Complete these steps in order. Boxes update automatically from live Horizon checks._

- [x] **Fund account** — Activate the account with XLM. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md#account-is-reported-unfunded))
- [x] **Add USDC trustline** — Configure the asset trustline. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md#trustline-is-missing))
- [x] **Verify XLM balance** — Meet the **1.5 XLM** reserve. ([FAQ](https://github.com/Stellar-TrustBridge/trustbridge-action/blob/main/docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md#xlm-reserve-too-low))

### Validation gate

- Ready to proceed: all checks passed.
- Passed checks: 3/3
- Failed checks: 0

### Balances

- **Native XLM balance:** \`10.5000000 XLM\`
- **Minimum required (XLM reserve):** \`1.5 XLM\`
- **USDC trustline balance:** \`50.0 USDC\`

### Setup cost estimate

- Stellar minimum account balance: **1 XLM**
- Base reserve per trustline (ledger entry): **0.5 XLM**
- Typical minimum to fund account + one trustline: **~1.5 XLM**

### Add a trustline

- [View account on Stellar Laboratory](https://laboratory.stellar.org/#account-viewer?network=public&account=GAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAWHF)
- [Open Transaction Builder (Change Trust)](https://laboratory.stellar.org/#txbuilder?network=public)
- [LOBSTR wallet](https://lobstr.co/) — add asset **USDC** from issuer \`GA5ZSEJYB37JRC5AVCIA5MOP4RHTM335X2KGX3IHOJAPP5RE34K4KZVN\`

### Configuration summary

| Input | Value |
| --- | --- |
| \`fail_on_missing\` | _default (true)_ |
| \`sticky_comment\` | _default (true)_ |
| \`wait_until_funded\` | \`false\` (default) |
| \`onboarding_checklist\` | \`true\` |

### Action outputs reference

_Use these output names in downstream workflow steps via \`steps.<id>.outputs.<name>\`._

| Output | Value in this run | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| \`account_funded\` | \`true\` | Whether the account exists on the Stellar network (from \`action.yml\`) |
| \`trustline_exists\` | \`true\` | Whether the **USDC** trustline is configured (from \`action.yml\`) |
| \`xlm_balance\` | \`10.5000000\` | Native XLM balance reported by Horizon (from \`action.yml\`) |
| \`native_balance\` | \`10.5000000\` | Native XLM balance (alias of \`xlm_balance\`, 7-decimal string) |
| \`asset_balance\` | \`50.0\` | USDC trustline balance (7-decimal string, \`0\` if no trustline, \`unknown\` on Horizon error) |
| \`comment_url\` | _set after posting_ | URL of this issue comment (from \`action.yml\`) |

